372 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 279 0 R
/E (The COVID-19 pandemic accelerated a structural shift already underway. What had been supplementary income for many became the primary livelihood for millions, as lockdowns wiped out formal and semi-formal employment. Between FY21 and FY25, gig worker numbers rose by 55%, embedding platform labour not as a crisis-era workaround but as a permanent feature of the economy.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
