/S /H3
/P 305 0 R
/T (Verdict: Supported. AI integration is restructuring the firm into a thinner, more networked structure, retaining strategic and client-facing functions while externalising supporting cognitive labour to a gig market operating without adequate regulatory protection.)
/E (Verdict: Supported. AI integration is restructuring the firm into a thinner, more networked structure, retaining strategic and client-facing functions while externalising supporting cognitive labour to a gig market operating without adequate regulatory protection.)
