/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 306 0 R
/T (Before AI-enabled platforms, engaging freelance legal expertise carried high information costs: assessing worker quality required professional network access or costly trial-and-error. Algorithmic matching eliminates this barrier. Platforms build comprehensive digital worker profiles, from location data, productivity metrics, acceptance rates, response latency, ratings, and sentiment analysis, and use these to match clients with workers whose past performance on similar tasks is algorithmically verified. Neither party requires an existing relationship. Transaction costs fall; gig adoption rises.)
/E (Before AI-enabled platforms, engaging freelance legal expertise carried high information costs: assessing worker quality required professional network access or costly trial-and-error. Algorithmic matching eliminates this barrier. Platforms build comprehensive digital worker profiles, from location data, productivity metrics, acceptance rates, response latency, ratings, and sentiment analysis, and use these to match clients with workers whose past performance on similar tasks is algorithmically verified. Neither party requires an existing relationship. Transaction costs fall; gig adoption rises.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [3]
>>
