/E (The partial merit deserves acknowledgment: modularisation can legitimately separate tasks that do not require licensure from those that do. A well-designed platform with clear task classification and meaningful supervision of licensed-practice components could capture disaggregation's efficiency benefits without the unauthorised practice risk. Existing platforms have not consistently achieved this.)
