/Title (Yes, in fact, independent practice has always been the norm in Indian law. Most practicing advocates work independently, especially at district and lower courts. Big-firm setups are reserved for high-value corporate matters \(M&A, amalgamations\) where confidentiality, team size, and risk demand institutional backing. GST consultants, in particular, very commonly work independently.)
/Dest [43 0 R /Fit]
