<<
/Title (Demand has grown significantly from millennials to Gen Z due to better awareness, accessible platforms, school counsellors, and social media. Gen Z is more proactive in seeking help and making lifestyle changes. Platforms and digital tools have made mental health support far more visible and available than before.)
