4159 0 obj
<<
/Title (Mental health represents one of the defining public health challenges of the twenty-first century. According to the World Health Organization's World Mental Health Today report \(September 2025\), more than one billion people, approximately one in seven individuals globally, are currently living with a mental health condition. Yet this scale of need has not translated into the delivery of care. The WHO's Mental Health Atlas 2024 reveals that global mental health spending has stagnated at a median of just two percent of health budgets, a figure unchanged since 2017, and in low-income settings, fewer than ten percent of people affected by psychosis receive any treatment at all.)
/Dest [28 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4131 0 R
/Next 4184 0 R
>>
endobj
